\pkg{r4subscore}, \pkg{r4subrisk}, \pkg{r4subtrace}, \pkg{r4subusability},
\pkg{r4subrepro}, and \pkg{r4subprofile} separately and stitching their
results together by hand, you pass the shared evidence table once and
